        "202530006": {
          "id": 202530006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Alright, that's bright enough.",
          "next": [
            202530008
          ]
        },
        "202530007": {
          "id": 202530007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "A little more color? Then let's bring out their true colors.",
          "next": [
            202530010
          ]
        },
        "202530008": {
          "id": 202530008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "A little more color? Then let's bring out their true colors.",
          "next": [
            202530009
          ]
        },
        "202530009": {
          "id": 202530009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text",
          "next": [
            202530011
          ]
        },
        "202530010": {
          "id": 202530010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "How did you know what I was gonna say next!?",
          "next": [
            202530011
          ]
        },
        "202530011": {
          "id": 202530011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "...What are you doing?",
          "next": [
            202530012
          ]
        },
        "202530012": {
          "id": 202530012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "I'm auditioning in Xianzhou!",
          "next": [
            202530013
          ]
        },
        "202530013": {
          "id": 202530013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Met an immersia director on the way here. Said I had pointy ears and extraordinary bones.",
          "next": [
            202530014
          ]
        },
        "202530014": {
          "id": 202530014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "They dragged me straight into a theater troupe and told me to play a cold-blooded, ruthless foxian enchantress.",
          "next": [
            202530015
          ]
        },
        "202530015": {
          "id": 202530015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Too bad I don't think I'm really cut out for that kind of character.",
          "next": [
            202530016
          ]
        },
        "202530016": {
          "id": 202530016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "I've run through the audition lines over and over, but I still can't nail that vibe the director wants. You know, a cold-blooded killer on the outside, tender and emotional on the inside.",
          "next": [
            202530017
          ]
        },
        "202530017": {
          "id": 202530017,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "next": [
            202530018,
            202530019
          ]
        },
        "202530018": {
          "id": 202530018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Evanescia, I've been your fan since Season 1, Episode 1 of that... whatever immersia!",
          "next": [
            202530020
          ]
        },
        "202530019": {
          "id": 202530019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Does it have to be a foxian enchantress? How about we try a different character, like a valiant Xianzhou heroine... Valianescia?",
          "next": [
            202530021
          ]
        },
        "202530020": {
          "id": 202530020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Thanks! I'm a big fan of yours too!",
          "next": [
            202530022
          ]
        },
        "202530021": {
          "id": 202530021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "No one knows me better than you!",
          "next": [
            202530022
          ]
        },
        "202530022": {
          "id": 202530022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "The director also had <i>Crouching Fox, Hidden Phantylia</i> in production and was looking for stunt performers, so they let me audition for a different character...",
          "next": [
            202530023
          ]
        },
        "202530023": {
          "id": 202530023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Without rules, there is no order. With this blade three feet long, I pass judgment upon the halls of power... Evanescia, enforcer of the Phantasmoon Alliance. Come, show me what you've got!",
          "next": [
            202530024
          ]
        },
        "202530024": {
          "id": 202530024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text",
          "next": [
            202530025
          ]
        },
        "202530025": {
          "id": 202530025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "The battle at Scalegorge Waterscape on set was just epic! I swear I nearly had an aqua sprite awakening right then and there.",
          "next": [
            202530026
          ]
        },
        "202530026": {
          "id": 202530026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "The drama and action scenes all came together perfectly! The director even said I'm a natural!",
          "next": [
            202530027
          ]
        },
        "202530027": {
          "id": 202530027,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "next": [
            202530028
          ]
        },
        "202530028": {
          "id": 202530028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "The tales of the Xianzhou's chivalrous heroes really get my blood pumping!",
          "next": [
            202530029
          ]
        },
        "202530029": {
          "id": 202530029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Anyway, I must be off. The high elder needs my help parting the waters.",
          "next": [
            202530030
          ]
        },
        "202530030": {
          "id": 202530030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Once my immersia is done filming, I'll send it your way!",
          "next": []
        }
      },
